# Merge to main

When the user says **merge to main**, **do merge to main**, or **merge it
to main**:

1. Confirm the change is on `dev` and the tests that belong with it pass.
2. Open a PR from `dev` to `main` (`gh pr create --base main --head dev`).
3. Merge that PR so `.github/workflows/deploy-prd.yml` runs.

Do not skip the PR. Do not laptop-deploy prd. Pushing `dev` only updates
the dev account.
